sequenceDiagram
    participant User as 👤 User<br/>(Student/Employer/Admin)
    participant Frontend as 🖥️ Frontend<br/>(Next.js Pages)
    participant Middleware as 🔒 Middleware<br/>(JWT Auth)
    participant API as 🔌 API Route<br/>(Next.js API)
    participant Service as ⚙️ Business Logic<br/>(Service Layer)
    participant DB as 💾 MongoDB<br/>(Database)
    participant External as 🌐 External Services<br/>(Cloudinary, Email, ML)

    Note over User,External: Authentication Flow
    User->>Frontend: Login Request (Email, Password)
    Frontend->>API: POST /api/auth/login
    API->>Service: Verify Credentials
    Service->>DB: Query User Collection
    DB-->>Service: User Data
    Service->>Service: Hash Password Check
    Service->>Service: Generate JWT Token
    Service-->>API: Token + User Data
    API-->>Frontend: Set HttpOnly Cookie + Response
    Frontend-->>User: Redirect to Dashboard

    Note over User,External: Job Application Flow
    User->>Frontend: Browse Jobs / Search
    Frontend->>API: GET /api/jobs?filters
    API->>Middleware: Verify JWT Token
    Middleware-->>API: Valid Token
    API->>Service: Fetch Jobs with Filters
    Service->>DB: Query Jobs Collection
    DB-->>Service: Job Listings
    Service->>Service: Filter Active Jobs Only
    Service-->>API: Filtered Jobs
    API-->>Frontend: Job Data
    Frontend-->>User: Display Jobs

    User->>Frontend: Apply for Job
    Frontend->>API: POST /api/jobs/[id]/apply
    API->>Middleware: Verify Token & Role
    Middleware-->>API: Student Role Valid
    API->>Service: Create Application
    Service->>DB: Insert Application Record
    Service->>External: Upload CV to Cloudinary
    External-->>Service: CV URL
    Service->>DB: Update Application with CV URL
    Service->>External: Send Notification Email
    DB-->>Service: Application Created
    Service-->>API: Application Data
    API-->>Frontend: Success Response
    Frontend-->>User: Application Submitted

    Note over User,External: Application Tracking Flow
    User->>Frontend: View Application Status
    Frontend->>API: GET /api/applications/[id]
    API->>Middleware: Verify Token
    API->>Service: Fetch Application
    Service->>DB: Query Application + Stages
    DB-->>Service: Application with Status
    Service-->>API: Application Data
    API-->>Frontend: Status Information
    Frontend-->>User: Display Status Dashboard

    Note over User,External: AI Recommendation Flow
    User->>Frontend: View Dashboard
    Frontend->>API: GET /api/jobs/recommended
    API->>Middleware: Verify Token
    API->>Service: Get Recommendations
    Service->>DB: Fetch User Profile & History
    Service->>DB: Fetch All Active Jobs
    Service->>External: ML Service (ml-knn)
    External->>External: Calculate Similarity Scores
    External-->>Service: Recommended Job IDs
    Service->>DB: Fetch Recommended Jobs
    DB-->>Service: Job Details
    Service-->>API: Recommended Jobs
    API-->>Frontend: Recommendations
    Frontend-->>User: Display Recommended Jobs

    Note over User,External: Digital Contract Flow
    User->>Frontend: Create Contract
    Frontend->>API: POST /api/contracts/create
    API->>Middleware: Verify Token & Role
    Middleware-->>API: Employer Role Valid
    API->>Service: Create Contract Template
    Service->>DB: Store Contract Draft
    Service->>External: Generate Contract PDF
    External-->>Service: Contract Document
    Service->>External: Upload to Cloudinary
    External-->>Service: Document URL
    Service->>DB: Update Contract with URL
    Service->>External: Send E-Signature Request
    External-->>Service: Signature Link
    Service-->>API: Contract Created
    API-->>Frontend: Contract Data
    Frontend-->>User: Contract Ready for Signing

    Note over User,External: Stage-Based Messaging Flow
    User->>Frontend: Send Message
    Frontend->>API: POST /api/messages/send
    API->>Middleware: Verify Token
    API->>Service: Validate Stage Requirement
    Service->>DB: Check Application Stage
    DB-->>Service: Current Stage
    alt Stage Allows Messaging
        Service->>DB: Store Message
        Service->>External: Send Notification
        Service-->>API: Message Sent
        API-->>Frontend: Success
    else Stage Doesn't Allow
        Service-->>API: Error: Stage Restriction
        API-->>Frontend: Error Message
    end
    Frontend-->>User: Message Status

    Note over User,External: Admin Approval Flow
    User->>Frontend: Sign Up (Employer/Student)
    Frontend->>API: POST /api/auth/signup
    API->>Service: Create User Account
    Service->>DB: Insert User (isApproved: false)
    Service->>External: Send Approval Notification
    DB-->>Service: User Created
    Service-->>API: User Data
    API-->>Frontend: Pending Approval
    Frontend-->>User: Redirect to Pending Page

    Admin->>Frontend: View Pending Users
    Frontend->>API: GET /api/admin/pending-users
    API->>Middleware: Verify Admin Role
    API->>Service: Fetch Pending Users
    Service->>DB: Query Users (isApproved: false)
    DB-->>Service: Pending Users List
    Service-->>API: Users Data
    API-->>Frontend: Pending Users
    Frontend-->>Admin: Display List

    Admin->>Frontend: Approve User
    Frontend->>API: POST /api/admin/approve-user
    API->>Service: Update Approval Status
    Service->>DB: Update User (isApproved: true)
    Service->>External: Send Approval Email
    DB-->>Service: User Approved
    Service-->>API: Success
    API-->>Frontend: User Approved
    Frontend-->>Admin: Confirmation





